  "statuteText": "249:5 Deputy Fire Wardens. –\n\nThe state forester may appoint as deputy forest fire wardens the section foremen or such other railroad employees as the authorized officials of the railroad may recommend. Such deputies, when so appointed, shall be vested with the powers and duties of deputy forest fire wardens, except as such powers and duties are limited or extended hereby."
